# Room 5: the Cold Reactor. Two cooling towers and no steam. A fence, a
# gate with a barrier, a guard booth, and a rock on the right with the
# cave mouth in it. The lane on the left runs north beside the fence.
# Outlines first, fills after: a fill only replaces white.

